{
  "id": "energy_balance_and_energy_ratio",
  "title": "Energy Balance and Energy Ratio",
  "description": "Energy balance and energy payback ratio calculator. Calculate system energy output related to system energy input.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Energy Balance and Energy Ratio\n\nThe terms \"energy balance\" and \"energy payback ratio\", or \"energy ratio\", are used to describe system energy output related to system energy input.\n\n## Energy Balance Formula\n\n**dE = Eo - Ei**\n\nWhere:\n- **dE** = energy balance\n- **Eo** = energy output\n- **Ei** = energy input\n\n## Energy Ratio Formula\n\n**ER = Eo / Ei**\n\nWhere:\n- **ER** = energy ratio\n- **Eo** = energy output\n- **Ei** = energy input"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "energy_output",
          "label": "Energy Output (Eo)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "energy_input",
          "label": "Energy Input (Ei)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "defaultValue": 100
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "energy_balance",
          "label": "Energy Balance (dE)",
          "formula": "inputs.energy_output - inputs.energy_input",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "energy_ratio",
          "label": "Energy Ratio (ER)",
          "formula": "inputs.energy_output / inputs.energy_input",
          "unit": "ratio",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "type": "bar",
        "title": {
          "text": "Energy Balance Analysis"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "Energy Output",
            "Energy Input",
            "Energy Balance"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "Energy (kWh)"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "data": [
              "inputs.energy_output",
              "inputs.energy_input",
              "inputs.energy_output - inputs.energy_input"
            ],
            "type": "bar",
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#5470c6"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}